,"text":"霞光片片映香台，花下红妆笑靥开。\n预卜明朝天色好，愿郎游骑得重来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其三 九里松风","author":"徐熥","text":"虬龙千尺翠烟凝，九里涛声浪几层。\n油壁青骢堤上过，同心犹记结西陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其四 孤山梅月","author":"徐熥","text":"梅花十亩映湖塘，历乱幽魂处处香。\n淡月一轮疏影见，青铜镜里寿阳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其五 桃溪花雨","author":"徐熥","text":"桃溪春色武陵同，落尽残英阵阵风。\n暗出袖中花一片，问郎何似夜来红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其六 石屋晴云","author":"徐熥","text":"石屋云开淡复浓，青山微露半芙蓉。\n一时游女红妆湿，身在高唐第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其七 綵鹢红妆","author":"徐熥","text":"湖心歌管遏春云，水底榴花六幅裙。\n转过苏堤欢不见，停桡齐上岳王坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其八 锦塘春柳","author":"徐熥","text":"三月寻春到锦塘，青青垂柳一丝长。\n折来戏作同心结，不是同心不赠郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其九 龙泓漱玉","author":"徐熥","text":"骊珠不动小龙眠，井水无波玉镜鲜。\n携手与郎同一照，忽惊花发并头莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖十景竹枝词 其十 鹫岭观曦","author":"徐熥","text":"啼罢天鸡曙色微，鹫峰高处见朝晖。\n傍人不用歌行露，夜与郎游尚未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]